{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-job-36-1","title":"Job 36:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Elihu shews how God is just in his ways. 16 How Job's sins hinder God's blessings. 24 God's works are to be magnified.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-2","title":"Job 36:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Suffer. 21:3; 33:31-33; Heb 13:22 I have yet to speak, etc. Heb. there are yet words for God. 13:7,8; 33:6; Ex 4:16; Jer 15:19; Eze 2:7; 2Co 5:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-3","title":"Job 36:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>fetch. 28:12,13,20-24; 32:8; Pr 2:4,5; Mt 2:1,2; 12:42; Ac 8:27-40 Ro 10:6-8; Jas 1:5,17; 3:17 ascribe. 32:2; 34:5,10-12; De 32:4; Ps 11:7; 145:17; Jer 12:1; Da 9:7,14 Ro 3:25,26; 9:14; Re 15:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-4","title":"Job 36:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>my. 13:4,7; 21:27,34; 22:6-30 Pr 8:7,8; 2Co 2:17 perfect. 37:16; Lu 1:3; Ac 24:22; 1Co 14:20; *marg: Col 4:12; 2Ti 3:16,17 in. Ps 49:3; Pr 22:20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-5","title":"Job 36:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>despiseth. 10:3; 31:13; Ps 22:24; 138:6 mighty. 9:14,19; 12:13-16; 26:12-14; 37:23; Ps 99:4; 147:5; Jer 10:12; 32:19 1Co 1:24-28 wisdom. Heb. heart.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-6","title":"Job 36:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>preserveth. 21:7-9,30; Ps 55:23; Jer 12:1,2; 2Pe 2:9 giveth. 29:12-17; Ps 9:12; 10:14,15; 72:4,12-14; 82:1-4; Pr 22:22,23 Isa 11:4 poor. or, afflicted. Ex 22:22-24; Ps 140:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-7","title":"Job 36:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>withdraw. 2Ch 16:9; Ps 33:18; 34:15; Zep 3:17; 1Pe 3:12 with. 1:3; 42:12; Ge 23:6; 41:40; 1Sa 2:8; Es 10:3; Ps 78:70-72; 113:7,8 he doth. 2Sa 7:13-16; Ps 112:7-10; 2Th 3:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-8","title":"Job 36:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>if. 13:27; 19:6; 33:18,19; Ps 18:5; 107:10; 116:3; La 3:9 cords. Pr 5:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-9","title":"Job 36:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>he. 10:2; De 4:21,22; 2Ch 33:11-13; Ps 94:12; 119:67,71; La 3:39,40 Lu 15:17-19; 1Co 11:32 their. Ps 5:10; Isa 59:12; Eze 18:28-31; Ro 5:20; 1Ti 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-10","title":"Job 36:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>openeth. 15; 33:16-23; Ps 40:6; Isa 48:8,17; 50:5; Ac 16:14 commandeth. Pr 1:22,23; 8:4,5; 9:4-6; Isa 1:16-20; 55:6,7; Jer 4:3,4; 7:3-7 Eze 18:30,31; Ho 14:1; Mt 3:8; Ac 3:19; 17:30; Jas 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-11","title":"Job 36:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>If. 22:21; De 4:30; Jer 7:23; 26:13; Ro 6:17; Heb 11:8 spend. 11:13-19; 21:11; 22:23; 42:12; Ec 9:2,3; Jas 5:5; Re 18:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-12","title":"Job 36:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>if. De 18:15-22; 29:15-20; Isa 1:20; 3:11; Ro 2:8,9 perish. Heb. pass away. die. 4:21; Joh 8:21-24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-13","title":"Job 36:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>heap. Nu 32:14; 2Ch 28:13,22; Ro 2:5 they. 15:4; 27:8-10; 35:9,10; Mt 22:12,13 bindeth. 8; Ps 107:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-14","title":"Job 36:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>They die. Heb. Their soul dieth. 15:32; 21:23-25; 22:16; Ge 38:7-10; Le 10:1,2; Ps 55:23 unclean. or, sodomites. Ge 19:5,24,25; De 23:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-15","title":"Job 36:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>delivereth. 6 poor. or, afflicted. openeth. 10; 2Ch 12:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-16","title":"Job 36:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>a broad. 19:8; 42:10-17; Ps 18:19; 31:8; 40:1-3; 118:5 that which should be set on thy table. Heb. the rest of thytable. full. Ps 23:5; 36:8; 63:5; Isa 25:6; 55:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-17","title":"Job 36:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>fulfilled. 16:5; 34:8,36; Ro 1:32; Re 18:4 take hold on thee. should uphold thee.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-18","title":"Job 36:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Because. Ps 2:5,12; 110:5; Mt 3:7; Ro 1:18; 2:5; Eph 5:6 his. Ps 39:10; Isa 14:6; Eze 24:16 then. 33:24; Ps 49:7,8; 1Ti 2:6; Heb 2:3 deliver thee. Heb. turn thee aside.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-19","title":"Job 36:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Will. Pr 10:2; 11:4; Isa 2:20; Zep 1:18; Jas 5:3 nor all. 9:13; 34:20; Ps 33:16,17; Pr 11:21; Isa 37:36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-20","title":"Job 36:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Desire. 3:20,21; 6:9; 7:15; 14:13; 17:13,14 cut. Ex 12:29; 2Ki 19:35; Pr 14:32; Ec 11:3; Da 5:30; Lu 12:20; Ac 1:25 1Th 5:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-21","title":"Job 36:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>regard. Ps 66:18; Eze 14:4; Mt 5:29,30 this. 34:7-9; 35:3; Da 3:16-18; 6:10; Mt 13:21; 16:24; Ac 5:40,41 Heb 11:25; 1Pe 3:17; 4:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-22","title":"Job 36:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>God. 1Sa 2:7,8; Ps 75:7; Isa 14:5; Jer 27:5-8; Da 4:25,32; 5:18; Lu 1:52 Ro 13:1 who. Ps 94:10,12; Isa 48:17; 54:13; Jer 31:38; Joh 6:45</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-23","title":"Job 36:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Who hath. 34:13-33; Isa 40:13,14; Ro 11:34; 1Co 2:16; Eph 1:11 Thou. 8:3; 34:10; 40:8; Ro 2:5; 3:5; 9:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-24","title":"Job 36:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>magnify. 12:13-25; 26:5-14; Ps 28:5; 34:3; 72:18; 86:8-10; 92:4,5; 104:24 Ps 107:8,15; 111:2-4,8; 145:10-12; Jer 10:12; Da 4:3,37; Lu 1:46 which. De 4:19; Ps 19:1-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-26","title":"Job 36:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>God. 37:5; Ps 145:3 we. 11:7-9; 26:14; 37:23; 1Ki 8:27 neither. Ps 90:2; 102:24-27; Heb 1:12; 2Pe 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-27","title":"Job 36:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>he. 5:9; 38:25-28,34; Ge 2:5,6; Ps 65:9-13; Isa 5:6; Jer 14:22 the vapour. 33; Ps 148:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-28","title":"Job 36:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>37:11-13; Ge 7:11,12; Pr 3:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-29","title":"Job 36:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>the spreadings. 37:16; 38:9,37; 1Ki 18:44,45; Ps 104:3 the noise. 37:2-5; Ps 18:13; 29:3-10; 77:16-19; 104:7; Na 1:3; Hab 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-30","title":"Job 36:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>he. 38:25,34,35; Lu 17:24 and. 38:8-11; Ge 1:9; Ex 14:22,28; 15:4,5; Ps 18:11-16; 104:5-9 bottom. Heb. roots.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-31","title":"Job 36:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>by 37:13; 38:22,23; Ge 6:17; 7:17-24; 19:24; Ex 9:23-25; De 8:2,15 Jos 10:11; 1Sa 2:10; 7:10; 12:18 he giveth. 38:26,27; Ps 65:9-13; 104:13-15,27,28; 136:25; Ac 14:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-32","title":"Job 36:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>Perhaps these difficult verses should be rendered, \"He covereth the concave with lightning, and chargeth it what it shall strike. Its noise declareth concerning him; a magazine of wrath against iniquity.\"</p>\n<p>26:9; Ex 10:21-23; Ps 18:11; 135:7; 147:8,9; 148:8; Ac 27:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-36-33","title":"Job 36:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":36,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":36,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>noise. 29; 37:2; 2Sa 22:14; 1Ki 18:41-45 the cattle. Jer 14:4-6; Joe 1:18; 2:22 the vapour. Heb. that which goeth up. 27</p>"}]}